cff-version: 1.2.0
title: retrieval-eval
message: >-
  If you use this software or the judgment format in academic work, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - name: retrieval-eval contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/aton-of-data/retrieval-eval
abstract: >-
  A portable format for relevance judgments, a strict superset of TREC qrels that adds
  content-addressed chunk identity, a corpus fingerprint, label provenance and strata, with two
  reference implementations providing deterministic retrieval metrics and drift detection over
  it.
keywords:
  - information retrieval
  - evaluation
  - relevance judgments
  - qrels
  - retrieval-augmented generation
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
